notes: >-
  CMR-V1 (the prospectively frozen cross-mechanism study) has an incomplete source-level
  reproducibility status that is confined to that study: artefact internal consistency,
  CPU-CUDA numerical parity and decision-level determinism all pass, but the two source
  files that produced the frozen extraction run are not present at their recorded hashes.
  CMR-V1 is a supplementary negative replication (terminal decision CMR-D, protocol stop,
  X3-X5 never run) and is not used to broaden the manuscript's claim. The Phase 0-5
  evidence chain has its own protocol snapshots and artifact hashes and is unaffected.
  Fields left out of this file (ORCIDs for authors other than the first, DOI, release date,
  commit) were not known at the time of writing and are deliberately omitted rather than
  guessed.
